  "question": {
    "text": "For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#948;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>&#8469;</mi></math>, if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>e</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>e</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#947;</mi></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>&#948;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>&#8734;</mo></munderover><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is constant of integration, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#948;</mi></math> is equal to",
